<h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2></div>
<div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-trigger"><span class="faq-q">Is Lonavala good for monsoon pre-wedding shoots?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body"><p>Yes, July to September is when Lonavala looks its absolute best. Bhushi Dam overflows dramatically, the hills turn vivid green, and the valley fog creates incredibly atmospheric images. We monitor weather forecasts and will reschedule at no charge if heavy rain makes shooting impossible.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-trigger"><span class="faq-q">How far is Lonavala from Pune?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body"><p>Lonavala is approximately 65 km from Pune, about 1.5 hours by car via the Mumbai-Pune Expressway. For sunrise sessions, we recommend leaving Pune by 5 AM to reach viewpoints before 6:30 AM.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-trigger"><span class="faq-q">What are the best shoot timings at Lonavala?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body"><p>Golden hour in the morning between 6 AM and 8 AM gives the softest and most flattering natural light. For Bhushi Dam, arrive by 7 AM to 8 AM on weekdays to avoid crowds. Tiger Point at sunrise is spectacular with valley fog.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-trigger"><span class="faq-q">What are the best places for a couple shoot in Lonavala?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body"><p>Lion's Point, Tiger Point, Rajmachi Point, Bhushi Dam and Karla Caves are the most popular. Lion's Point is known for valley views and sunrise shots, and the fog gives a soft romantic look. The best spot depends on your theme and the season.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-trigger"><span class="faq-q">Do you help with poses and outfits?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body"><p>Yes. We guide you on poses, outfits and styling so your photos look natural and flattering.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-trigger"><span class="faq-q">How many photos will we get?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-body"><p>It depends on the package. You get 50 to 300 professionally edited high-resolution photos, and cinematic highlights with some packages.</p></div></div></div></section>
